         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Finding the Missing Number\n\nNumbers can follow an order. When we count, we move forward one step at a time: 1, 2, 3, 4...\n\nIn this game, three numbers appear in order, but one of them is hidden. The numbers grow by one at each step. Look at the numbers before and after the hidden one to find the number that completes the sequence.\n\nUse the arrows to change your answer. When you find the missing number, you earn points. You can play as many times as you want.",
